{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 五行十元｜发型特征总览 v1.1\n\n**五行＝广义父项｜五大主题＝叙事领域 is-a狭义｜形状＝视觉／发型领域 is-a狭义**\n\n[[01-十元系统/05-十元语义空间/狭义视觉库/00_十元形状感受与轴变换上游正本_v0.3.md|形状正本v0.3]]　[[14-角色库/十元发型Canvas/01_十元形状与轴变换总览.canvas|十元形状Canvas]]\n\n⚠ 旧“散、碎、羽化＝xz”作废。旧水库9个xz条目等待逐图重审。","x":-1000,"y":-1400,"width":2000,"height":420,"color":"4"},{"id":"method","type":"text","text":"## 判定顺序\n\n1. 分整体轮廓、内部纹理、局部尖束。\n2. 看X/Y轴与发束局部长轴L、横轴W。\n3. 先判几何候选，再检查十元语义发动机。\n4. 保存十元配比度与单十元本征准度。\n5. 形状不能替代人物、状态、场域层判断。\n\n**已确认形状8/10：** x、z、n、nx、nz、zn、zx、xz。\n**待补：** xn、x并z。","x":-850,"y":-850,"width":1700,"height":480,"color":"3"},{"id":"wood-group","type":"group","label":"木｜zx ↔ nx｜方向与作用权来源","x":-3300,"y":0,"width":1250,"height":1900,"color":"4"},{"id":"wood","type":"text","text":"# 木｜发型领域广义\n\n**五行轴：** zx ↔ nx｜方向与作用权来源\n\n**叙事狭义：** 因果 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 木\n\n视觉层必须以形状正本和领域卡为准，不得从主题词直接反推发型。","x":-3200,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":350,"color":"4"},{"id":"fire-group","type":"group","label":"火｜zn ↔ x｜本体成立与危险边界","x":-1900,"y":0,"width":1250,"height":1900,"color":"1"},{"id":"fire","type":"text","text":"# 火｜发型领域广义\n\n**五行轴：** zn ↔ x｜本体成立与危险边界\n\n**叙事狭义：** 本体 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 火\n\n视觉层必须以形状正本和领域卡为准，不得从主题词直接反推发型。","x":-1800,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":350,"color":"1"},{"id":"earth-group","type":"group","label":"土｜n ↔ x并z｜内外空间与承载界面","x":-500,"y":0,"width":1250,"height":1900,"color":"6"},{"id":"earth","type":"text","text":"# 土｜发型领域广义\n\n**五行轴：** n ↔ x并z｜内外空间与承载界面\n\n**叙事狭义：** 空间 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 土\n\n视觉层必须以形状正本和领域卡为准，不得从主题词直接反推发型。","x":-400,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":350,"color":"6"},{"id":"metal-group","type":"group","label":"金｜xn ↔ z｜规则分布与长度节点","x":900,"y":0,"width":1250,"height":1900,"color":"5"},{"id":"metal","type":"text","text":"# 金｜发型领域广义\n\n**五行轴：** xn ↔ z｜规则分布与长度节点\n\n**叙事狭义：** 时间 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 金\n\n视觉层必须以形状正本和领域卡为准，不得从主题词直接反推发型。","x":1000,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":350,"color":"5"},{"id":"water-group","type":"group","label":"水｜xz ↔ nz｜临界危险与回返停靠","x":2300,"y":0,"width":1250,"height":1900,"color":"2"},{"id":"water","type":"text","text":"# 水｜发型领域广义\n\n**五行轴：** xz ↔ nz｜临界危险与回返停靠\n\n**叙事狭义：** 命运 --is-a狭义[叙事]→ 水\n\n视觉层必须以形状正本和领域卡为准，不得从主题词直接反推发型。","x":2400,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":350,"color":"2"},{"id":"zx","type":"text","text":"## zx｜菱形｜主动推出\n\n中部展开，力量由结构自身主动推出并占据方向。\n\n发型：强斜扫、外翻、上挑、后冲。\n\n最近邻：静止危险是x；等待触发爆发是xz。","x":-3200,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"nx","type":"text","text":"## nx｜方形｜横向散开\n\nX轴扩散、碎束块面化、横向铺展、让出中心空间。\n\n发型：散碎、多束、轻薄横向展开。\n\n**散碎优先检查nx，不得自动判xz。**","x":-2650,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"4"},{"id":"zn","type":"text","text":"## zn｜长椭圆｜自成生长体\n\n纵向完整、两端圆润，依靠自然材质与生长状态成立。\n\n发型：自然卷、长椭圆卷团、自成体纹理。","x":-1800,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"x","type":"text","text":"## x｜三角｜刀\n\n危险物品本身：锐利、切割、尖刺、直接伤害边界。\n\n发型：V形、尖角、锐斜切面；中央刘海压缩X轴、厚平刘海压缩Y轴。\n\nx可以静止，不要求主动释放。","x":-1250,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"1"},{"id":"n","type":"text","text":"## n｜圆形／梯形｜包裹承载\n\n圆融或下宽容积，把外部发束纳入脸侧、头型与主体中承接。\n\n发型：帘幕、八字、框脸、脸侧承接。","x":-400,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"6"},{"id":"xbz","type":"text","text":"## x并z｜几何本征 pending\n\n已确认语义：内部结构外化成壳、幕、片、屏与界面。\n\n发型：厚宽屏刘海、遮眼外壳、双层界面。\n\n**未获用户确认前，不声明几何本征形。**","x":150,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"6"},{"id":"xn","type":"text","text":"## xn｜几何本征 pending\n\n已确认语义：规则分布到多个节点，以对称、等距、重复和流程维持整体。\n\n发型：规则中分、等距编发、对称重复。\n\n**未获用户确认前，不声明几何本征形。**","x":1000,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"z","type":"text","text":"## z｜长方形｜长度节点\n\nY轴／局部长轴拉长，横向宽度大体稳定，形成等宽长片。\n\n发型：两侧长刘海、稳定长束、长度截点。","x":1550,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"5"},{"id":"xz","type":"text","text":"## xz｜长三角｜火药桶\n\n危险储存在整个连续结构中，对一个触发点高度敏感；触发后可能整体爆发或失控。\n\n发型：厚主体＋引信式尖端、长楔形。\n\n**长三角不是充分条件；散、碎、乱、羽化均不等于xz。**","x":2400,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"nz","type":"text","text":"## nz｜扁椭圆｜柔软停靠\n\n低重心、横向圆钝、柔软回落与停靠。\n\n发型：蓬松横向轮廓、扁圆外形、柔和回接。\n\n整体扁椭圆不能被内部几根尖发改判为xz。","x":2950,"y":520,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"2"},{"id":"wood-ref","type":"file","file":"14-角色库/刘海98种/02_五行十元重组/五行库/木/木_zx-nx.canvas","x":-2920,"y":1350,"width":520,"height":380},{"id":"fire-ref","type":"file","file":"14-角色库/刘海98种/02_五行十元重组/五行库/火/火_zn-x.canvas","x":-1520,"y":1350,"width":520,"height":380},{"id":"earth-ref","type":"file","file":"14-角色库/刘海98种/02_五行十元重组/五行库/土/土_n-x并z.canvas","x":-120,"y":1350,"width":520,"height":380},{"id":"metal-ref","type":"file","file":"14-角色库/刘海98种/02_五行十元重组/五行库/金/金_xn-z.canvas","x":1280,"y":1350,"width":520,"height":380},{"id":"water-ref","type":"file","file":"14-角色库/刘海98种/02_五行十元重组/五行库/水/水_xz-nz.canvas","x":2680,"y":1350,"width":520,"height":380},{"id":"compare","type":"text","text":"# 最近邻与数字字段\n\n```text\nx＝刀｜xz＝火药桶｜zx＝挥出的刀\nnx＝散碎方形｜nz＝扁椭圆｜zn＝长椭圆｜z＝长方形\n```\n\n- 十元配比度：十项合计100%。\n- 本征映射准度：每个十元独立0–100。\n- 旧水库9个xz条目为 legacy-pending-review，逐图重审前不得用于现行排行。\n- xn、x并z几何本征仍pending。","x":-1200,"y":2100,"width":2400,"height":520,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e-method-wood","fromNode":"method","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"wood","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-method-fire","fromNode":"method","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"fire","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-method-earth","fromNode":"method","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"earth","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-method-metal","fromNode":"method","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"metal","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-method-water","fromNode":"method","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"water","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-wood-zx","fromNode":"wood","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"zx","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-wood-nx","fromNode":"wood","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"nx","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-fire-zn","fromNode":"fire","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"zn","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-fire-x","fromNode":"fire","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"x","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-earth-n","fromNode":"earth","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-earth-xbz","fromNode":"earth","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xbz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-metal-xn","fromNode":"metal","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xn","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-metal-z","fromNode":"metal","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"z","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-water-xz","fromNode":"water","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-water-nz","fromNode":"water","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"nz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-zx-ref","fromNode":"zx","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"wood-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-nx-ref","fromNode":"nx","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"wood-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-zn-ref","fromNode":"zn","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"fire-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-x-ref","fromNode":"x","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"fire-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-n-ref","fromNode":"n","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"earth-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-xbz-ref","fromNode":"xbz","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"earth-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-xn-ref","fromNode":"xn","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"metal-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-z-ref","fromNode":"z","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"metal-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-xz-ref","fromNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"water-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-nz-ref","fromNode":"nz","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"water-ref","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-method","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"method","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-earth-compare","fromNode":"earth-ref","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"compare","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-metal-compare","fromNode":"metal-ref","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"compare","toSide":"top"}],"metadata":{"version":"1.0-1.0","frontmatter":{"type":"five-elements-ten-yuan-hairstyle-feature-overview","status":"active-shape-revision","version":"1.1","canonical_path":"14-角色库/十元发型Canvas/00_五行十元发型特征总览.canvas"}}}